  "python_stdlib": {
    "coverage": "Union of CPython 3.10–3.15 release-baseline top-level sys.stdlib_module_names, including platform-specific and optional modules. Python starters require >=3.10. Refresh from release headers when supporting newer Python; tests detect running-interpreter drift. Matching uses the normalized, case-sensitive module name, only for Python profiles.",
